{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 0,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There is a retired couple somewhere in\nthis country, bringing in a comfortable"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4240,
    "dDurationMs": 4820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "income every year, who will owe the tax\nman almost nothing on it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 9120,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not through some clever loophole."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 11180,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not through a shelter only the rich can\nafford."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 14300,
    "dDurationMs": 4660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is because their money arrives in forms\nthe government is simply not allowed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 18960,
    "dDurationMs": 4940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to tax. There are seven kinds of income\nlike this, written right into the law,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 24040,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and here is the quiet tragedy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 26440,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Most seniors know only one of them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 29100,
    "dDurationMs": 6840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The other six sit there unused for an\nentire retirement, quietly"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 35940,
    "dDurationMs": 4540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "costing thousands of dollars every single\nyear."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 40660,
    "dDurationMs": 6160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So today I am going to walk you through\nall seven, in plain language,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 47040,
    "dDurationMs": 6040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "starting with the one that touches nearly\nevery person watching this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 53080,
    "dDurationMs": 6200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because the more of your money you can\nmove into these seven forms, the less"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 59280,
    "dDurationMs": 4340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of it the tax man ever gets to see."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 63780,
    "dDurationMs": 5020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let me start with the one that reaches\nalmost all of you, because it is the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 68800,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "most misunderstood of them all."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 70420,
    "dDurationMs": 4740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Your Social Security check. Most people\nbelieve the government taxes every"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 75160,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "dollar of it. That is simply not true."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 77860,
    "dDurationMs": 6100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For a great many retirees, the tax man is\nnot allowed to touch a single penny"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 83960,
    "dDurationMs": 5240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of that check. If your total income for\nthe year stays under a certain line,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 89320,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and for a single person that line sits\naround twenty five thousand dollars,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 93700,
    "dDurationMs": 5160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then every dollar of your Social Security\ncomes to you completely tax free."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 99000,
    "dDurationMs": 5480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And even for those who earn more, the law\nsays only a portion of it can ever"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 104480,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "be taxed, never the whole thing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 107120,
    "dDurationMs": 5220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A slice of your Social Security is always\nyours, no matter what."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 112580,
    "dDurationMs": 5680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So here is the lesson. The lower you can\nkeep the rest of your income, the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 118260,
    "dDurationMs": 5360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "more of your Social Security the\ngovernment has to hand over untouched."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 123820,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this is where so many good people trip\nthemselves."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 127000,
    "dDurationMs": 5300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They pull too much from the wrong account\none year, push their income over"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 132300,
    "dDurationMs": 5260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that line, and end up taxing their own\nSocial Security check without ever meaning"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 137560,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to. Knowing where the line sits is how you\nstay under it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 141940,
    "dDurationMs": 4100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Think of a widow living on her Social\nSecurity and one small pension."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 146240,
    "dDurationMs": 4900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For years she dreaded every spring, sure\nthe tax man was owed a piece of her"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 151140,
    "dDurationMs": 5320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "check, until someone finally showed her\nthat her income sat under the line,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 156460,
    "dDurationMs": 6200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and her whole Social Security was hers,\ntax free, every single"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 162660,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "year. Nothing in her life changed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 165340,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "She simply learned the rule, and stopped\noverpaying out of fear."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 169780,
    "dDurationMs": 4700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The second kind is one the wealthy have\nquietly used for generations, and there"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 174480,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is no reason it cannot be yours too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 177420,
    "dDurationMs": 5040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you lend money to your own state,\nyour city, or your local school district,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 182460,
    "dDurationMs": 4480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by buying what are called municipal bonds,\nthe interest they pay back to you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 186940,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is free from federal tax. Read that again."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 189740,
    "dDurationMs": 5440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You collect a steady stream of income,\nmonth after month, and the tax man is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 195180,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "not invited to any of it. It is one of the\nonly ways left to build yourself"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 199580,
    "dDurationMs": 3620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a paycheck in retirement that the federal\ngovernment cannot tax."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 203440,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now I will be straight with you, the way a\nreal friend would."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 206620,
    "dDurationMs": 4780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That tax free interest can still count\nwhen they decide how much of your Social"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 211400,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Security to tax, so it is not pure magic."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 214460,
    "dDurationMs": 5540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But as a way to earn income the federal\ngovernment cannot directly reach, it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 220000,
    "dDurationMs": 4660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "has stood for a hundred years, and it is\nsitting right there for ordinary people,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 224660,
    "dDurationMs": 5260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "not just the rich. The third is the most\npowerful account almost no one over"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 229920,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "sixty five is ever told about, and that is\nthe health savings account."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 234160,
    "dDurationMs": 4260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you were able to put money into one\nduring your working years, that money"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 238420,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is now sitting there with a rare and\nbeautiful quality."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 241000,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you take it out to pay for a medical\ncost, and in retirement there are"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 244600,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "always medical costs, it comes out\ncompletely tax free."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 247840,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Think about how unusual that is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 249920,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You were never taxed putting it in."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 252500,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It grew for years without tax."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 255220,
    "dDurationMs": 5080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it comes out without tax, to cover the\nvery bills that frighten older people"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 260300,
    "dDurationMs": 4580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the most. There is no other account in the\nentire tax code that is kind to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 264880,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you at all three of those moments."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 266980,
    "dDurationMs": 4660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you are lucky enough to have one, guard\nit, and spend it on your health"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 271640,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "costs before you touch almost anything\nelse you own."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 274720,
    "dDurationMs": 6180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The fourth is a comfort I want every one\nof you to hold onto, especially if"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 280900,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you carry a policy to protect the people\nyou love."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 284060,
    "dDurationMs": 4940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When a life insurance policy pays out to\nyour family after you are gone, that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 289000,
    "dDurationMs": 4120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "money reaches them completely free of\nincome tax."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 293340,
    "dDurationMs": 5700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Every dollar you meant for them lands in\ntheir hands as a full dollar, not"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 299040,
    "dDurationMs": 4360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a taxed and shrunken one. The government\ndoes not get to take a cut of the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 303400,
    "dDurationMs": 2180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "gift you spent a lifetime paying for."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 305800,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if you carry a policy, rest easy"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 308900,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "knowing it is doing exactly what you\nhoped."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 312180,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is delivering your love to your family\nwhole, and untouched."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 316720,
    "dDurationMs": 5440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The fifth one surprises almost everyone,\nbecause they have been taught to fear"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 322160,
    "dDurationMs": 5520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it. An inheritance. When money or property\nis left to you by someone who has"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 327680,
    "dDurationMs": 6120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "passed, you, the person receiving it, do\nnot owe income tax simply for"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 333800,
    "dDurationMs": 5600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "receiving it. Not on the savings they left\nyou, not on the home, not on the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 339400,
    "dDurationMs": 1720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "money in most of their accounts."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 341340,
    "dDurationMs": 4540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are a few narrow exceptions with\ncertain retirement accounts, and those"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 345880,
    "dDurationMs": 5120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are worth asking about, but the plain and\nreassuring truth is this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 351120,
    "dDurationMs": 6420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Receiving what a loved one left you is not\na taxable event for"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 357540,
    "dDurationMs": 5120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you. The old fear that the tax man swoops\nin and takes a huge bite out of an"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 362660,
    "dDurationMs": 6440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "ordinary inheritance is, for the vast\nmajority of families, simply not real."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 369220,
    "dDurationMs": 3580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The sixth is the one most people have\nactually heard of, so I will keep it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 372800,
    "dDurationMs": 320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "short."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 373880,
    "dDurationMs": 5160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Money in a Roth account. You paid the tax\non it years ago, going in, and because"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 379040,
    "dDurationMs": 4660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of that, every dollar you pull out in\nretirement, along with all the growth"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 383700,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it earned over the years, comes to you tax\nfree, for the rest of your life."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 388100,
    "dDurationMs": 3620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you have one, it may quietly be the\nsingle most valuable pile of money you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 391720,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "own, because it is the one the government\nhas already been paid on and can"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 395620,
    "dDurationMs": 4300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "never come back to tax again. And the\nseventh, quickly, because it touches"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 399920,
    "dDurationMs": 1940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so many of you who own a home."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 402020,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you sell the house you have lived in,\nthe law lets you keep a very large"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 406020,
    "dDurationMs": 1880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "share of the profit with no tax at all."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 408040,
    "dDurationMs": 4440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For a single person, that shield covers up\nto two hundred fifty thousand dollars"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 412480,
    "dDurationMs": 3640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of gain, and for a married couple, up to\nfive hundred thousand."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 416580,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For most seniors selling the family home,\nthat means the profit lands in your"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 420300,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "pocket whole, while the tax man is left\nstanding outside the door."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 423940,
    "dDurationMs": 5460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And here is a piece of good news for this\nvery year that ties all seven together."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 429400,
    "dDurationMs": 6020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For twenty twenty six, the amount of\nincome an older person can"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 435420,
    "dDurationMs": 4660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "earn before owing any federal tax at all\nwent up again."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 440180,
    "dDurationMs": 5380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Between the regular deduction, the extra\none you get for being over sixty five,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 445840,
    "dDurationMs": 6040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and a brand new bonus deduction just for\nseniors, a single older"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 451880,
    "dDurationMs": 6040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "person can now shield well over twenty\nthousand dollars of income from federal"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 457920,
    "dDurationMs": 3700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "tax, and a married couple far more."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 461840,
    "dDurationMs": 5100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now stack that on top of these seven tax\nfree forms of income, and you can"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 466940,
    "dDurationMs": 4060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "see the picture. A great many retirees can\narrange their money so that the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 471000,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "federal government collects almost nothing\nfrom them at all."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 474600,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But you have to know the pieces exist\nbefore you can ever put them together."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 478780,
    "dDurationMs": 4700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So before you go, hold on to the real\nlesson here, because it is bigger than"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 483480,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "any single one of these seven."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 485460,
    "dDurationMs": 4760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The wealthy do not pay less tax because\nthey earn less."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 490440,
    "dDurationMs": 6190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They pay less because they learned, long\nago, which forms of income the tax"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 496630,
    "dDurationMs": 5250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "man is not allowed to touch, and they\nquietly moved their money into those"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 501880,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "forms. Every one of those seven doors is\nopen to you too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 507020,
    "dDurationMs": 2780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You do not need a fortune to walk through\nthem."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 509920,
    "dDurationMs": 3580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You only need to know that they are there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 513780,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the next time someone tells you that\nheavy taxes in retirement are just"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 517440,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a fact of life you have to accept, you\nwill know better."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 520920,
    "dDurationMs": 3580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A great deal of your money can be arranged\nto come home to you whole."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 524680,
    "dDurationMs": 4300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you know someone who is quietly\noverpaying the tax man year after year,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 529160,
    "dDurationMs": 3220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "certain they have no choice, please share\nthis with them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 532460,
    "dDurationMs": 4480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It may be the one thing that finally lets\nthem keep what they worked a whole"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 536940,
